        "body": "Source (twilite repository):\n- `components/NodeGraph/membraneChain.js`\n- `components/NodeGraph/membraneGeometry.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/utils/graphWorkspace.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/validators/validateGraphInvariants.js`\n\nFocused tests (twilite repository):\n- `tests/membraneGeometry.test.js`\n- `tests/graphWorkspace.test.js`\n- `tests/workspaceCamera.test.js`\n\nThese pointers identify evidence to inspect. Structural validation does not prove runtime or browser behavior.",
